<title>HUNGARY: TVK REPORTS 9-MONTH OPERATING PROFIT OF HUF 6.974BLN.</title>
<headline>TVK REPORTS 9-MONTH OPERATING PROFIT OF HUF 6.974BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month period ending Sept</p>
<p>30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-Sept 96     Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	6,974.0    vs   16,236.0</p>
<p>Group profit before interest,</p>
<p>     extraordinaries and tax    7,438.0    vs   14,284.0</p>
<p>Group profit before tax and</p>
<p>     extraordinaries		8,278.0    vs   15,517.0</p>
<p>Group profit before</p>
<p>     extraordinaries		7,018.0    vs   13,032.0</p>
<p>    Group sales revenue	  45,705.0    vs   60,667.0</p>
<p>    Group costs of sales	 31,906.0    vs   36,375.0</p>
<p>    Gross profit		   13,799.0    vs   24,292.0</p>
<p>General, administrative</p>
<p>     expenses			 6,825.0    vs    8,056.0</p>
<p>    Other revenue		   3,121.0    vs    3,577.0</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	    2,657.0    vs    5,529.0</p>
<p>    Interest revenue		1,233.0    vs    2,199.0</p>
<p>    Interest expenditure	    393.0    vs	966.0</p>
<p>    Taxation			  1,260.0    vs    2,485.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Tiszai Vegyi Kombinat Rt is a chemical company. The</p>
<p>figures are consolidated, are unaudited and are calculated</p>
<p>according to International Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
